'''Mining Epic''' (進化の虹獣石, ''Shinka no Niji Jūseki'', '''Evolving Rainbow Beast Stone''') is a [[Catfruit|Behemoth Stone]] gathering event added in [[Version 12.0 Update|Version 12.0]]. It is unlocked after clearing [[Atonement for Sin]]. Its only stage, [[Seven Lights of Doom (Merciless)|Seven Lights of Doom]], drops one Epic Behemoth Stone per clear and can be cleared up to three times per appearance.

